    {
        "text": "Sister...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get out of here, Amiya. There could be more Reunion on the way. Do we have any injured? I can help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're retreating?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to politely suggest that you don't fight anymore, snow bunny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you keep using your Arts like that, you're going to die. You're just burning your life into power.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or, you could always come to Rhodes Island. We've got ways to extend your life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't look at me like that... I don't need your pity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do I look like I pity you? You're strong. I respect you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
