        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sup? Where's FrostNova?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your commander fell down there too, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could we not fight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rabbit of Rhodes Island, could we forge a temporary armistice? Honestly, we never much wanted to fight you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mephisto told our sister you'd killed Alex, and she was very concerned about what you would do next.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who's Alex?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Skullshatterer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry. I did kill Skullshatterer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Infected really should not fight one another. I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's to apologize for? It was a battle, wasn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It was.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "So let's have a ceasefire. Nesti, what do you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? *Ursine profanity*!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nesti says he's fine with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think that's what he said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as we're not in battle, there's no reason to kill anyone, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is it... you want a ceasefire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you ever notice that both our sides are led by rabbits?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think something in my brain just broke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1#5",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "These are the yetis of the ice field?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh- what do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shouldn't they be cold, merciless killers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's prejudiced.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen here, bunny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who wins the battle, or where you go, none of that matters to us. All we care about is our sister's life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're worried about your friend too, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Right. We didn't come here to hurt anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're definitely not here to hunt Reunion for sport, are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You know... it's funny...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it weren't for Patriot insisting on unity in the Reunion Movement, we'd have dealt with Mephisto and his people a long time ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that'd be kinda like hunting Reunion for sport, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get digging, shall we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
